{"ID":"20240205153831-p945dml","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153831-p945dml","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153831-p945dml\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206083136-ihthbov\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240616082451-w9r036r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4389,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619171906-zex30x6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"024地黄\u0026amp;熟地黄","type":"doc","updated":"20240801142337"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206083136-ihthbov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083136-ihthbov","updated":"20240206083210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产山东、山西、河南、河北等地。\n【性状】\t鲜地黄：呈纺锤形或圆柱形条状，长824cm。外皮薄，表面浅红黄色，具弯曲的纵皱纹、芽痕、横长皮孔及不规则疤痕。肉质，易断，断面皮部淡黄白色，可见橘红色油点，木部黄白色。气微，味微甜、微苦。生地黄呈不规则的圆形或长圆形块状，长612cm，直径36cm；表面灰棕色或灰黑色，全体皱缩不平，具不规则的横曲纹；细小的多为长条状，稍扁而扭曲；质柔软，干后则坚实，体重，不易折断，断面平坦，紫黑色或乌黑色而光亮，显油润，具粘性；气微香，味微甜。熟地黄：为不规则的块片、碎块，大小、厚薄不一。表面乌黑色，有光泽，粘性大。质柔软而带韧性，不易折断，端面乌黑色，有光泽。味甜。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083218-ez0d62c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083218-ez0d62c"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】\t鲜地黄：甘、苦，寒。生地黄：甘，寒。熟地黄：甘，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083215-ia5ggun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083215-ia5ggun"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】\t鲜地黄清热生津凉血止血；生地黄清热凉血，养阴生津；熟地黄滋阴补血，益精填髓。可用于阴虚发热，消渴，吐血，衄血，血崩，月经不调，胎动不安，阴伤便秘等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083216-jh7or7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083216-jh7or7w"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炙品】\t熟地黄：取干地黄加黄酒30％，拌和，入蒸器中，蒸至内外黑润，取出晒干即成。或取干地黄置蒸器中蒸8小时后，焖一夜，次日翻过再蒸48小时再焖一夜，取出，晒至八成干，切片后，再晒干。熟地为不规则的块状，内外均呈漆黑色，外表皱缩不平。质柔软，断面滋润，中心部往往可看到光亮的油脂块，粘性甚大，昧甜。滋阴，补血。治阴虚血少，腰膝痿弱，劳嗽骨蒸，遗精，崩漏，月经不调，消渴，溲数，耳聋，目昏。\n熟地黄炭：取熟地黄放煅锅内，装八成满，上面覆盖一锅，两锅接台处用黄泥封固，上压重物，用文武火煅至贴在盖锅底上的白纸显焦黄色为度，挡住火门，待凉后，取出；或将熟地黄置锅内直接炒炭亦可。有止血收敛功效。"}]},{"ID":"20240206083138-0aiwiyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083138-0aiwiyd","updated":"20240206083138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206083138-9r7ghve.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240206083145-v8bl58p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206083145-v8bl58p","updated":"20240206083145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206083145-tr9fwf1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155921-1cmqeoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155921-1cmqeoh","updated":"20240205170005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生地黄"}]},{"ID":"20240205170002-ot1hqc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170002-ot1hqc1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"生地黄"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/生地黄-20240205155921-3h9grsm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205170007-4heij56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170007-4heij56","updated":"20240205170009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"熟地黄"}]},{"ID":"20240205170011-4z6jw8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205170011-4z6jw8e","updated":"20240205170011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data"